WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:03.906
Later Ally and Flo were wiping tables.

2
00:00:03.907 --> 00:00:07.166
Flo suddenly looked at her phone.

3
00:00:07.167 --> 00:00:09.615
"Do you mind if I leave now?"

4
00:00:09.616 --> 00:00:13.823
"Sure," Ally said. "Is everything all right?"

5
00:00:13.824 --> 00:00:19.012
"Yep! Thanks!" Flo hurried out of the diner.

6
00:00:19.013 --> 00:00:23.842
"Boy, everything doesn't seem all right with her," Ally thought.

7
00:00:23.843 --> 00:00:25.923
"Something must be wrong.

8
00:00:25.924 --> 00:00:30.068
I'll ask her next time I see her."

9
00:00:30.069 --> 00:00:33.581
Jerry and Sally came in a few minutes later.

10
00:00:33.582 --> 00:00:36.474
Ally greeted them with a smile.

11
00:00:36.475 --> 00:00:39.096
"Are you here to film us again?"

12
00:00:39.097 --> 00:00:43.423
"No," Jerry said. "We thought we'd grab a bite to eat."

13
00:00:43.424 --> 00:00:47.704
"Well, you're in for a treat." Ally grinned.

14
00:00:47.705 --> 00:00:53.151
"I don't want to brag, but we're the best restaurant in town!"

15
00:00:53.152 --> 00:00:57.531
Jerry and Sally sat down, and Ally brought them menus.

16
00:00:57.532 --> 00:01:02.270
"This is going to be a fun episode of the show," Jerry said.

17
00:01:02.271 --> 00:01:05.414
"There are good teams in Sandville.

18
00:01:05.415 --> 00:01:08.594
But I think Pepe's is the one to beat."

19
00:01:08.595 --> 00:01:10.500
"Ugh!" Ally thought.

20
00:01:10.501 --> 00:01:14.106
"Well, we're not worried!" she said brightly.

21
00:01:14.107 --> 00:01:19.375
"Rolling Ray's is going to roll over all the competition!"

22
00:01:19.376 --> 00:01:22.246
"They sure are!" someone said.

23
00:01:22.247 --> 00:01:23.663
Ally spun around.

24
00:01:23.664 --> 00:01:29.316
Mateo's mother had just entered, followed by Kate and Bethany.

25
00:01:29.317 --> 00:01:32.848
"Dawn, you're here!" Ally gave Dawn a hug.

26
00:01:32.849 --> 00:01:36.059
"It's good to see you, Ally," Dawn said.

27
00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:39.034
"I ran into the girls on my way over here.

28
00:01:39.035 --> 00:01:41.547
They told me about the cook-off."

29
00:01:41.548 --> 00:01:44.806
"And about our double date," Bethany said.

30
00:01:44.807 --> 00:01:48.595
"What are you going to wear, Ally?" Kate asked.

31
00:01:48.596 --> 00:01:53.241
"You should wear something cute but casual," Dawn said.

32
00:01:53.242 --> 00:01:54.695
"I have an idea!

33
00:01:54.696 --> 00:01:59.938
Why don't we all go shopping to find you a new outfit?"

34
00:01:59.939 --> 00:02:02.947
"Sure, that sounds fun," Ally said.

35
00:02:02.948 --> 00:02:04.978
"I finish working soon."

36
00:02:04.979 --> 00:02:09.237
"We'll get something to eat and wait for you," Dawn said.

37
00:02:09.238 --> 00:02:13.014
They sat down, and Kate pulled out her phone.

38
00:02:13.015 --> 00:02:16.833
"Hey, look." She showed everyone her screen.

39
00:02:16.834 --> 00:02:22.281
"Some of the other food trucks have begun announcing the dishes they'll be serving at the cook-off."

40
00:02:22.282 --> 00:02:24.970
"Yum!" Bethany said.

41
00:02:24.971 --> 00:02:32.946
"Ella's Eats is going to serve a club sandwich with turkey, chips, a fried egg, and a spicy sauce."

42
00:02:32.947 --> 00:02:35.571
"Spicy eggs?" Ally said.

43
00:02:35.572 --> 00:02:39.537
"With turkey and chips? Oh no!

44
00:02:39.538 --> 00:02:44.189
That sounds like Barry's new sandwich.

45
00:02:44.190 --> 00:02:48.668
He's going to have to come up with something else for our team."

46
00:02:48.669 --> 00:02:51.737
"Ally?" Jerry waved her over.

47
00:02:51.738 --> 00:02:55.833
"Bad news. We just got a text and have to go. We'll

48
00:02:55.834 --> 00:02:59.044
take a rain check on eating here." Ally

49
00:02:59.045 --> 00:03:02.260
scratched her head as they hurried out. "What

50
00:03:02.261 --> 00:03:07.299
does the rain have to do with anything?" she thought. ***

51
00:03:07.300 --> 00:03:14.841
Later, after shopping with Dawn and her friends, Ally held up her new outfit.

52
00:03:14.842 --> 00:03:18.242
"What do you think, Alpha?" Ally asked.

53
00:03:18.243 --> 00:03:21.492
"I think a great many things," Alpha said.

54
00:03:21.493 --> 00:03:27.571
"I think we still have no way to get home. And I think . . ." She snorted.

55
00:03:27.572 --> 00:03:31.157
"Going on a date with a human is dangerous!"

56
00:03:31.158 --> 00:03:35.775
Ally rolled her eyes. "I meant about my outfit.

57
00:03:35.776 --> 00:03:41.599
And you don't have to remind me all the time that we don't have a way home—yet.

58
00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:45.638
But don't worry, we'll get back to Astralia one day."

59
00:03:45.639 --> 00:03:50.836
"One day on Earth is approximately 24 hours long. One year on Earth is—"

60
00:03:50.837 --> 00:03:56.322
"You don't have to tell me how time works here on Earth either," Ally said.

61
00:03:56.323 --> 00:04:01.990
"But why do you think going on a date is dangerous? Julius is very nice."

62
00:04:01.991 --> 00:04:07.898
"An Astralian's prime directive is to resolve conflicts and bring peace to the universe," Alpha said.

63
00:04:07.899 --> 00:04:10.665
"Not go on dates with Earthlings.

64
00:04:10.666 --> 00:04:16.385
You are getting distracted, Allyzooba, and becoming more and more like a human."

65
00:04:16.386 --> 00:04:18.634
"That's not true," Ally snapped.

66
00:04:18.635 --> 00:04:22.580
"And I'll prove it. Humans can't throw their voices."

67
00:04:22.581 --> 00:04:24.442
Ally looked out the window.

68
00:04:24.443 --> 00:04:27.605
There was a man walking a dog past the house.

69
00:04:27.606 --> 00:04:31.474
"Cute dog!" Ally said, throwing her voice behind them.

70
00:04:31.475 --> 00:04:34.244
"Huh?" The man looked confused.

71
00:04:34.245 --> 00:04:37.556
"Rover, did you hear that?"

72
00:04:37.557 --> 00:04:40.169
"See?" Ally said gleefully.

73
00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:42.512
"I'm nothing like a human!

74
00:04:42.513 --> 00:04:45.504
Plus, I'm being very helpful on this planet.

75
00:04:45.505 --> 00:04:50.039
I'm helping Barry with the contest so he can take special cooking classes.

76
00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:54.845
I'm helping Mateo buy a rare comic book."

77
00:04:54.846 --> 00:04:58.179
"Those are acceptable missions," Alpha mumbled.

78
00:04:58.180 --> 00:05:00.772
But she didn't sound very impressed.

79
00:05:00.773 --> 00:05:03.158
"Thank you," Ally said.

80
00:05:03.159 --> 00:05:10.255
"Just don't forget that I'm allowed to have some fun on Earth while I'm helping humans and bringing peace to the universe."

81
00:05:10.256 --> 00:05:16.459
"Fun?" Alpha snorted again. "Fun does not compute."

82
00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:21.078
"Well, I hope it does for my date with Julius," Ally said.

83
00:05:21.079 --> 00:05:27.663
"Because I really like him, and I hope he likes me too!"

84
00:05:27.664 --> 00:05:38.371
With that, Ally turned Alpha off and put away her new outfit.

